### 1. Register (tạo user test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Login lại để lấy token mới (có role ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Tạo book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalog/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "genre": "Fiction",
  "language": "vi",
  "description": "Sach test"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("bookId", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Tạo product variant (digital)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalog/books/{{bookId}}/variants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productType": "DIGITAL",
  "variantFormat": "EBOOK",
  "sku": "TEST-EBOOK-001",
  "price": 50000,
  "currency": "VND"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("variantId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Thêm vào giỏ hàng
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productVariantId": "{{variantId}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "ownershipType": "RENTAL"
}

### 6. Xem giỏ hàng
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Checkout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Test IPN (giả lập VNPay gọi về)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payment/vnpay/ipn?vnp_Amount=5000000&vnp_BankCode=NCB&vnp_OrderInfo=Thanh%20toan%20don%20hang%20fb2df46e-f90a-4cf8-958f-74c87633bd4a&vnp_ResponseCode=00&vnp_TmnCode=8UMWO5EJ&vnp_TransactionNo=14226112&vnp_TxnRef=fb2df46e-f90a-4cf8-958f-74c87633bd4a&vnp_SecureHash=c5345b7e4dee4e74f13947c65466c6cb2294fe1ad54c228c599f0389384c09098caa21cb689577577932147e96fcac4c8baf1301938193fc7c6c1650b7dda577
